#: processes/editing-hci-validation.bpmn:60
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Produces the proposed change and, once findings exist, weighs the options for it — accept, revise, discard — but stops short of choosing: Call_OptionsAnalysis records that the options were weighed, Task_RecordDecision in the editor's lane records what was chosen, and collapsing the two would let the same party both analyse and decide."
msgstr ""

